   "text": "Risks & Benefits of Using GMOs"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- While GMOs can be used for medical benefit, there is still **much concern about the potential impacts** of changing the genes of organisms, as well as the **ethics of genetically modifying animals**\n\n  - These concerns are often amplified when the GMOs are **crop plants destined for human consumption**"
